+**A Gym caveat found while doing this, since fixed.** Directory order used
+to matter. With the live directory read *first*, `fin-saccr-rwa-1790406697`
+came from the live copy, which didn't carry the retained manifest's *mixed*
+mark. The claim then counted that directory's pass: 4 of 10, up to $0.0835.
+The Gym now prefers the retained copy of a run and applies every manifest's
+marks to a run of that name wherever it's read from, so the mark holds and
+the directory is left out in either order.
 
